## MaleCNS dataset

MaleCNS v1.0 connectome data is **not** stored in this repository. It remains
under [CC BY 4.0](https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/).

`python -m flybrain download` fetches a prebuilt FlyBrain network (~260 MB)
derived from that dataset into `~/fly-data` (or `$FLY_DATA`). If you use the
connectome data, cite Berg et al. (2026) and follow the MaleCNS attribution
terms.

